; ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
; MGT FORK: pad the image back out to a full 4 KB.
;
; Upstream's font ends exactly at $1000 because upstream's data tables fill
; the space ahead of it.  This fork deleted 48 bytes of logo tables, so
; without this the image would assemble 48 bytes short, and a short image is
; not a cosmetic problem: the machine shadows a full $1000 bytes from ROM into
; RAM at reset, and anything past the end of a short file would be shadowed
; from whatever the emulator or the socket of an EPROM happens to return.
; ----------------------------------------------------------------------------

          ds        0x1000-$
